{"parse": {"title": "LF-08", "pageid": 97034, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LF-07\" title=\"LF-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LF-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B4.9D.E8.92.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"贝蒂\">贝蒂</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 贝蒂</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Bette</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>正<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>名<span class=\"color-value\"></span>字<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192208</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidatang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯葬在了基金会外，她独自躺在别的年代，不知何时就会随着时代的更替而消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂已经一人度过了很多个日夜，作为基金会的普通职员，她总有着处理不完的杂事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而闲下来的时候，贝蒂总会在那时初次见到新时代的走廊处望着廊外发呆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>贝蒂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>嗯？怎么了，梅根？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如今，贝蒂已与那名女性职员成为了同事，共同站在廊下旁观时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>你在拍什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅根好奇地看着贝蒂怀中的摄影机，那是她用薪水在新时代中买到的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>没拍什么……就只是带着它……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想用完那盘胶片，但却总找不到打开镜头的契机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>毕竟整理仓库之类的杂活没什么好拍的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>如果你每天都在做一些重复的机械性工作，那确实是没什么乐趣可言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅根背了过去，将双肘搭在了扶手上，百无聊赖地看着天花板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可骚乱突然充斥人群，一名奔跑的女性将紧张的气氛带了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-562720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-562720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-562720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">匆忙的女性：</div><div>“暴雨”倒计时！“暴雨”倒计时！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>哦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅根恢复了平常的站姿，拍了拍贝蒂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>有得忙了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>“暴雨”倒计时，也就是说24小时之后会出现“暴雨”现象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>你也快回去吧，你那边应该也不会轻松。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅根说完便离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>新的时代，又要被收纳了吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuetushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuetushuguan\"><img alt=\"daxuetushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-daxuetushuguan.png/600px-Cg-daxuetushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-daxuetushuguan.png/900px-Cg-daxuetushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-daxuetushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-daxuetushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>清点时代藏品……检查历史记录……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>懵懂地接受了“暴雨”前的准备工作后，贝蒂坐在如山般杂乱的储藏室，检查着编号与物品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>用灯泡烤肉的土耳其烤肉机……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂在表格上打了个勾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-304510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-304510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-304510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>超迷你电视机……他们到底在发明什么东西？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只是一场繁杂又无趣的清点，但贝蒂的手颤抖着，“暴雨倒计时”像一只无形的大手抓住了她的心脏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>基金会之外，又将迎来一场天翻地覆，这其中也包括——琼斯的墓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-304513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>接下来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>泡泡供氧机，哈，现在轮到神秘学家了是吗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-304510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-304510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-304510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>幸运饼干喀嚓喀嚓鞋……嗯……我觉得有点浪费食物了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂麻木地确认着清单，然后走向了另一个架子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>《月夜之舞》……上映于2月23日……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂有些惊讶地抬眼看了一眼架子，上面摆满了胶片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出于对琼斯死去的抵触，在仓库工作后，她还从未靠近过这个架子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>1940年……1939年……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>也就是说……这里……难道也该会有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂快步走到存放着30年代电影的架子，那里整齐地存放着一盒盒的胶片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>有我当过替身的，也有琼斯参演的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂扫视着排列整齐的胶片，盒盒都在提醒她岁月已逝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>可琼斯马上就要消失了。如同化石一般，被覆盖在我无法触及到的时间地壳之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“镜头下的你多可爱啊，贝蒂……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>琼斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯逝世之后，贝蒂再也没有碰过有关于电影的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我到底该拍些什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">“是！”</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">“不！”</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">“啊——”</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuetushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuetushuguan\"><img alt=\"daxuetushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-daxuetushuguan.png/600px-Cg-daxuetushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-daxuetushuguan.png/900px-Cg-daxuetushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-daxuetushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-daxuetushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回忆闪过，贝蒂已经将答案了然于心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-304501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>琼斯，我不会把你一个人丢在陌生的时代里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>剧本呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂翻箱倒柜着，将杂物堆了一地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我的剧本呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她寻找着，最后终于在床的夹缝中找到了那本她手写出来的剧本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>在这一页，那个小角色！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂直接翻到了那一页，即使在琼斯卧床期间，贝蒂也没有放弃排练自己的角色，因此那页已经有了不同于其他页的弯折。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂将摄影机架好，检查完胶片和光线后，她走到了镜头前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:center\">是</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:center\">不</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:center\">啊</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂终于不再在脑中演练，而是真正将它表演了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像剧本写的那样，贝蒂倒在了床上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只是简单的三句，也不需要什么演技，它也只是一个永远也无法上映的<br />电影中的小角色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂翻身下了床，将摄影机关闭，然后拿出了那盘胶片，急急奔出门去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gongmu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gongmu\"><img alt=\"gongmu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/600px-Cg-gongmu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/900px-Cg-gongmu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/1200px-Cg-gongmu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>墓地空无一人，这里躺着的人并不在意这个世界即将要发生什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂抱着一个精美的盒子，上面特意系上了歪歪扭扭的蝴蝶结丝带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>送给你，琼斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂将盒子放在了冰凉的墓碑前，直接打开了盒子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>这就是我们的电影，我拍完它了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>但这并不是全部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂从裤子口袋中拿出了一条空白的胶片，它被贴在透明玻璃板中，胶片早已过曝不能使用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我给自己留了一些，因为，我还没想好我到底应该拍什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>如果我们还能见面的话……我会再把它拿给你看的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>但现在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>墓碑没有做出任何反应，它就只是静静地听着，就像世界正平静地接受着即将到来的“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我已经明白了，世界不会等我喊“准备好了”之后才开幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>所以我不会停在过去，我会向前，也只能向前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伴随着“暴雨倒计时”的警报，贝蒂轻轻地擦了擦墓碑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我愿意相信，我们还会再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂望着墓碑上文字的凹痕，雕刻的痕迹似是潺潺的波纹，如河流般贯穿了琼斯的一生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>等你再回来的时候……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂晃了晃手中的胶片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我向你保证，它一定会很精彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:116%\">30年代最后的一部电影</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LF-08"}}